OL,4,CKenya and DR Congo agree to restore    
OL,5,Cties after tensions over conflict      
OL,6,GKenya's President William Ruto and his 
OL,7,GCongolese counterpart Felix Tshisekedi 
OL,8,Ghave agreed to restore full diplomatic 
OL,9,Gties between the two countries         
OL,10,Gfollowing tensions over the conflict   
OL,11,Gin eastern Democratic Republic of      
OL,12,GCongo.                                 
OL,14,FRelations between the two countries    
OL,15,Fhave soured since 2023 when DR Congo   
OL,16,Faccused Kenya of hosting leaders       
OL,17,Flaunching a rebel alliance, including  
OL,18,Fthe M23.                               
